{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u83b7\u53d6\u72ec\u5bb6\u60c5\u62a5\uff01\u901f\u52a0\u8425\u5730\u7fa4\uff1a481243717\uff0c\u6d3b\u52a8\u798f\u5229&amp;\u60ca\u559c\u5956\u54c1\u7b49\u4f60\u6765\u6218\uff01</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New coop-game product positioning:\u00a0Theatrical Party Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Online multiplayer gameplay:\u00a0Tabletop-style DM + Scripted Roleplay + Co-op/Competitive Mini-Games</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can complete the game with your friends in 3 hours and have a definite fun! Play in the afternoon and have dinner together after the game!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2.5D viewing angle to prevent 3D dizziness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camera is orthogonal at 30 degrees downwards, and the camera rotates fixedly at 45 degrees (in four directions). Even those who are dizzy with 3D can play it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/381afbc3154c3561ff1abfbaa9937915.poster.avif?t=1755530156\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/381afbc3154c3561ff1abfbaa9937915.webm?t=1755530156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/381afbc3154c3561ff1abfbaa9937915.mp4?t=1755530156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to get started</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be completed with 7 keyboard keys + mouse, everything is designed to be easy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Story Players: Traditional RPG Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have conversations, get information, make decisions, get rewards, and advance the plot: it's that simple!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/5a00cd44dd77a30fb23a5ec1b4829af3.poster.avif?t=1755530156\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/5a00cd44dd77a30fb23a5ec1b4829af3.webm?t=1755530156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/5a00cd44dd77a30fb23a5ec1b4829af3.mp4?t=1755530156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1 Player with a destiny: a new way to play as a director</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Destiny Keeper, also known as the Director, God, or Dungeon Master, holds godlike powers that must not be revealed lightly. The Destiny Keeper can take on the roles of various NPCs within the game world to interact with story players. Their goal is to act as an observer\u2014adjusting and guiding the flow to provide the best possible experience for others. At the end of the game, other players will rate the Destiny Keeper's performance, allowing them to take part in the final MVP selection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/6ac08550298c1bf6ddba370fbb229ce2.poster.avif?t=1755530156\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/6ac08550298c1bf6ddba370fbb229ce2.webm?t=1755530156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/6ac08550298c1bf6ddba370fbb229ce2.mp4?t=1755530156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simplified all-in-one system: Character Status Item System(CSIS)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A multifunctional system that integrates character equipment, backpack, BUFF bar, and task log! Say goodbye to the complicated opening and closing of multiple interfaces, all information is in front of you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/36c3517af2f0847751d0fa9ebb2c1419.poster.avif?t=1755530156\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/36c3517af2f0847751d0fa9ebb2c1419.webm?t=1755530156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/36c3517af2f0847751d0fa9ebb2c1419.mp4?t=1755530156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mini-game: confrontation and cooperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interspersed in the storyline, it draws on the essence of multiplayer online party games, focusing on simple design, easy to use, strong interaction, and high fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stylized hand-painted graphics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D modeling + hand-painted textures + 3D rendering, dedicated to reproducing the cultural world of the Three Kingdoms at the end of the Eastern Han Dynasty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3360690?t=1755530156","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3360690?t=1755530156","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/dff059fd79af5cbb4f9b6a51d6c5c41d322436f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755530156","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it