o/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Easy to get started</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be completed with 7 keyboard keys + mouse, everything is designed to be easy!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Story Players: Traditional RPG Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have conversations, get information, make decisions, get rewards, and advance the plot: it's that simple!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/5a00cd44dd77a30fb23a5ec1b4829af3.poster.avif?t=1755530156\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/5a00cd44dd77a30fb23a5ec1b4829af3.webm?t=1755530156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/5a00cd44dd77a30fb23a5ec1b4829af3.mp4?t=1755530156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1 Player with a destiny: a new way to play as a director</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Destiny Keeper, also known as the Director, God, or Dungeon Master, holds godlike powers that must not be revealed lightly. The Destiny Keeper can take on the roles of various NPCs within the game world to interact with story players. Their goal is to act as an observer\u2014adjusting and guiding the flow to provide the best possible experience for others. At the end of the game, other players will rate the Destiny Keeper's performance, allowing them to take part in the final MVP selection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3360690/extras/6ac08550298c1bf6ddba370fbb229ce2.poster.avif?t=1755530156\" width=800 height=450 ><sour